    "body": "It appears there was a PR, #3547, that sent an event to the webhook. It was probably a spam PR, since the PR and the user (LuluDavey) who sent it are now deleted.\r\n\r\nStill investigating how this could impact master. The webhook shouldn't even be running on master, really...",
